  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6347.02 Scope. This part shall apply to foster parents who receive stipends twice per month based on a daily rate per age of the child from the department of health and human services (DHHS) based on credentials for foster family care services provided to children.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6347) #9266, eff 9-20-08; ss by #11181, INTERIM, eff 9-19-16, EXPIRES: 3-18-17; ss by #12134, eff 3-18-17; ss by #13055, eff 6-16-20",
